# 🌐 Cisco Packet Tracer Learning Roadmap

> From Beginner → CCNA Fundamentals → Cybersecurity Networking

---

# 1️⃣ Networking Fundamentals

| Type | Task |
|------|------|
| 📖 THEORY | What is a Network? |
| 📖 THEORY | LAN, WAN, MAN, PAN |
| 📖 THEORY | Network Devices (Router, Switch, Hub, Firewall) |
| 📖 THEORY | OSI Model (7 Layers) |
| 📖 THEORY | TCP/IP Model |
| 📖 THEORY | Encapsulation Process |
| 📖 THEORY | Ports & Protocols |
| 🛠️ PRACTICAL | Build a simple PC-to-PC network |
| 🛠️ PRACTICAL | Test connectivity using Ping |

### Checklist

- [ ] Know OSI Model
- [ ] Know TCP/IP Model
- [ ] Understand encapsulation
- [ ] Explain common protocols

---

